    {
      "name": "WebhookVerificationError",
      "kind": "class",
      "ref": "convohop.webhooks#WebhookVerificationError",
      "anchor": "webhookverificationerror-class",
      "signatures": ["class WebhookVerificationError(Exception)"],
      "docs": "A delivery that failed verification. The message never contains secrets, signatures or the body.\n\nChecks run in this order and stop at the first failure:\n\n- `INVALID_SECRET`: no secret is given, or one is not `whsec_` followed by padded standard Base64 of 24 to\n  64 bytes. This is your configuration, not the sender.\n- `MISSING_HEADER`: `webhook-id`, `webhook-timestamp` or `webhook-signature` is absent or empty.\n- `INVALID_HEADER`: one of those headers is repeated.\n- `INVALID_TIMESTAMP`: `webhook-timestamp` is not 1 to 15 ASCII digits (integer Unix seconds).\n- `TIMESTAMP_EXPIRED`: the timestamp is more than `tolerance_seconds` before now.\n- `TIMESTAMP_FUTURE`: the timestamp is more than `tolerance_seconds` after now.\n- `BODY_TOO_LARGE`: the body exceeds 4096 bytes.\n- `TOO_MANY_SIGNATURES`: `webhook-signature` has more than 8 entries.\n- `NO_MATCHING_SIGNATURE`: no `v1` entry matches any secret.\n- `INVALID_BODY`: `verify()` only; the signed body is not a UTF-8 JSON event envelope.",
      "members": [
        {
          "name": "code",
          "kind": "property",
          "ref": "convohop.webhooks#WebhookVerificationError.code",
          "anchor": "webhookverificationerrorcode-property",
          "signatures": ["code: WebhookVerificationCode"],
          "docs": ""
        },
        {
